      "writtenOn": "2025-03-31T20:41:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since the alignment is going to vary per reservation call, I think it\u0027s cleaner if we just add the alignment as a parameter to `prepareStaticData`.\n\nThis alignment padding will also need to be zero\u0027ed when dealing with the arm execution bug.",
