      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-31T20:41:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we need to add the reservation\u0027s alignment to `CopyRange` so that we can align each target offset correctly here (and we also won\u0027t have to mutate the fAlignment anymore, that can remain the starting alignment).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 701,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 701,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "2ae2f31a81736b63f72824162e6a096381b4ad92",
